  "description": "The BACKROAD+ GRX RX600 is your introduction to powerful and epic e-gravel adventures. The modern frame design of this ROSE e-bike platform integrates the battery, motor and cables. Powerful from the first step – in the city, in the country and in the mountains. The BACKROAD+ has everything you expect from a modern gravel bike for the next generation. This ROSE e-gravel bike is equipped with a Ritchey Venture Max dropbar and a clean ROSE Square stem as well as a matching Shimano SC-E5003 display. The menu of the cycle computer is simple, compact and clear. The selection between the support modes Eco, Trail & Boost is made via the large and easy to operate buttons on the side of the bike computer. MORE ABOUT Shimano SC-E5003 Display • Buttons for selecting the assistance level (up/down) • Menu button for changing the display • Range/Distance/Total Distance • ADJUST > Setting mode • No on/off switch on the display The form-fit integrated Shimano EP8 motor delivers a maximum torque of 85 Nm at a weight of just 2.6 kg. Adjustable power allows you, the rider, to enjoy sensitive control and maximum flexibility. Thanks to minimal pedalling resistance, the result is a particularly natural and harmonious riding experience. MORE ABOUT Shimano EP8 Motor • Choice of three different modes: Eco, Trail & Boost. • Maximum torque 85 Nm. The torque assistance being provided depends on the strength of your pedal pressure * approx. 15.0 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt-black/piano-black/pure-white frame, size L, without pedals *Slight paint variances are possible at the fork.",
